OL,3,GNEWSARoof repairs approved to tackle
OL,4,Amuseum leaks
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoof repairs at a Grade I listed museum
OL,7,Fhave been approved in a bid to tackle
OL,8,Fsignificant and regular leaks which it
OL,9,Fis feared could eventually lead to
OL,10,Fhistoric items being damaged.
OL,12,FThe Yorkshire Museum in York's Museum
OL,13,FGardens has seen several near misses,
OL,14,Fwith leaks threatening to affect
OL,15,Fartefacts and fossils.
OL,17,FSenior curator Dr Andrew Woods said the
OL,18,Fmuseum was closing its galleries five
OL,19,Ftimes a year on average due to major
OL,20,Fleaks, which were preventing
OL,21,Finvestment.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
